    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's health programme in Arusha, Tanzania got a boost on Wednesday, July 18, 2012, with the announcement by the German government of financial support to the tune of € 10 million for the University's health programme in Arusha, Tanzania.",
